{"ref":"BDB, כָּזָב","hw":"כָּזָב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כָּזָב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Amos 2:4\" href=\"/Amos.2.4\">Am 2:4</a></sup> <strong>lie, falsehood, deceptive thing</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:2\" href=\"/Hosea.12.2\">Ho 12:2</a> + 19 times; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּזָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:10\" href=\"/Judges.16.10\">Ju 16:10</a> + 9 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּזְבֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:4\" href=\"/Amos.2.4\">Am 2:4</a>;—<em>lie, falsehood</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבֶּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:10\" href=\"/Judges.16.10\">Ju 16:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:13\" href=\"/Judges.16.13\">13</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:13\" href=\"/Hosea.7.13\">Ho 7:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:13\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.13\">Zp 3:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:27\" href=\"/Daniel.11.27\">Dn 11:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:7\" href=\"/Psalms.5.7\">ψ 5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:4\" href=\"/Psalms.58.4\">58:4</a>, so <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.8\">Ez 13:8</a> Co (by transp. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> with <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁוְא</span>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.9\">9</a>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָפִיחַ</span> (in Pr) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.19\">Pr 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.5\">14:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.5\">19:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.9\">9</a>; of false prophecies (divinations) c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְסַם כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.7\">Ez 13:7</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָסָם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.34\">21:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.28\">22:28</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.6\">13:6</a> 𝔊 Co (<span dir=\"rtl\">קָסוֹם כ׳</span>, for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶסֶם כ׳</span>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.19\">13:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּקֵּשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:3\" href=\"/Psalms.4.3\">ψ 4:3</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָצָה</span> <em>delight in</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:5\" href=\"/Psalms.62.5\">62:5</a>; so in the phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבַר־כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.8\">Pr 30:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.22\">19:22</a> = <em>liar</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵד כְּזָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.28\">21:28</a> = <em>false witness;</em> of idols as a <em>lie</em> (<em>res ementita</em>) <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:4\" href=\"/Amos.2.4\">Am 2:4</a>, so prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂטֵי כ׳</span> <em>those turning aside to a lie</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:5\" href=\"/Psalms.40.5\">ψ 40:5</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָ֫וֶן\" href=\"/BDB,_אָ֫וֶן\", dir=\"rtl\">אָוֶן</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיל\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיל\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיל</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, הֶ֫בֶל\" href=\"/BDB,_הֶ֫בֶל\", dir=\"rtl\">הֶבֶל</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, שׁקר\" href=\"/BDB,_שׁקר\", dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁקֶר</a>); then of empty human pretensions <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ וָשֹׁד יַרְבֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:2\" href=\"/Hosea.12.2\">Ho 12:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">Is 28:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁקֶר</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.17\">17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מַחְסֵה כ׳)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:10\" href=\"/Psalms.62.10\">ψ 62:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶבֶל</span>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּזֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:11\" href=\"/Psalms.116.11\">116:11</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם כְּזָבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.3\">Pr 23:3</a> = <em>deceptive</em> (disappointing) <em>bread</em>.","next":"BDB, כְּזִיב","prev":"BDB, כָּזַב"}